{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-5e6f-4a7b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
    "name": "Grinta - Self-hosted Dynamic Links",
    "description": "Postman collection for the Grinta deep-links API.\n\nIDENTIFIERS: the create body always uses the single `id` field. For `league` / `match` / `team` it must be the Football API id (league_id / fixture_id / team_id) — our internal id is not accepted and returns 404 (missing `id` returns 422). For `post` `id` is our internal id, and for `screen` it is the screen number. The response always stores the internal id in `target_id` and returns the external id as a helper (`league_id` / `fixture_id` / `team_id`), never a separate `match_id`.\n\nDYNAMIC CODE: every 'Create link' request has a test script that saves the returned data.code into the collection variable {{code}}. The Resolve / Click / Claim requests then use {{code}} automatically, so you do not copy/paste anything.\n\nSCREEN: `screen` is caller-supplied in the create body (0 to 4) and stored with the link. It is returned as a fixed key on resolve/click/claim, or null when omitted. Changing `screen` for the same target gives a different code.\n\nBASE URL: the collection variable base_url currently points to the local vhost http://appgrinta_1.test/api/v1. Change it to https://appgrinta.com/api/v1 to test production.\n\nNo auth:api token is required.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Create link",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create - post",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('Response has data.code', function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data).to.have.property('code');",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.code) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('code', json.data.code);",
                  "    console.log('Saved {{code}} = ' + json.data.code);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"post\",\n  \"id\": 20\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/deeplinks",
            "description": "Create (or reuse) a code for a published post using our internal `id`. Scheduled posts return 404. `screen` is omitted here, so the response has screen: null."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create - league by Football API id",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status is 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "pm.test('target_id is internal, league_id is the external id', function () {",
                  "    var d = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "    pm.expect(d).to.have.property('target_id');",
                  "    pm.expect(d).to.have.property('league_id');",
                  "    pm.expect(d).to.not.have.property('competition_id');",
                  "});",
                  "var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json && json.data && json.data.code) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('code', json.data.code);",
                  "    console.log('Saved {{code}} = ' + json.data.code);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"league\",\n  \"id\": 33,\n  \"screen\": \"1\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{base_url}}/deeplinks",
            "description": "Create (or reuse) a code for a competition by sending its Football API `league_id` (33 here) in `id`. The response keeps `target_id` as the internal competition id and returns `league_id` as a helper. `screen` is caller-supplied and stored with the link."
          }
        },
